<view class="page recommend-page"><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="local-banner">本地演练 · 按本机的拿手菜搭配</view><view class="eyebrow">不用纠结，给你几种好搭配。</view><view class="title">帮我搭一桌</view><view class="card preference-card"><view class="form-row"><view class="flex"><view class="dish-name">这桌几个人吃？</view><view class="muted">1–20 人，一起分享几道菜</view></view><input class="number-input" type="number" maxlength="2" value="{{people}}" data-field="people" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="label">不吃什么 / 过敏原</view><input class="input" placeholder="例如：花生、虾、牛奶" value="{{avoid}}" data-field="avoid" bindinput="input"/><button class="preference-more" bindtap="toggleAdvanced"><text>{{advanced?'收起口味与时间':'再选一下口味与时间'}}</text><text>⌄</text></button><block wx:if="{{advanced}}"><view class="label">喜欢的食材（可选）</view><input class="input" value="{{likes}}" data-field="likes" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：番茄、鸡蛋"/><view class="form-row"><text>单道菜最多几分钟</text><input class="number-input" type="number" value="{{maxMinutes}}" data-field="maxMinutes" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="form-row"><text>只选素食</text><switch checked="{{vegetarian}}" data-field="vegetarian" bindchange="toggle" color="#244B3B"/></view><view class="form-row"><text>不要辣</text><switch checked="{{mild}}" data-field="mild" bindchange="toggle" color="#244B3B"/></view></block><button class="primary" bindtap="generate" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">{{plans.length?'换几套好搭配':'看看这样搭好不好'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="note">{{message}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在从这间厨房挑选合适的菜…</view><view class="recommendation-card" wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-index="planIndex"><view class="plan-heading"><text class="plan-index">0{{planIndex+1}}</text><view class="flex"><view class="dish-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.reason}}</view></view></view><view class="plan-dish" wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:key="dish_id" wx:for-item="dish"><text class="flex">{{dish.name}}</text><text class="plan-portions">{{dish.quantity}} 份</text></view><view class="plan-warning">{{item.warning}}</view><button class="primary" data-index="{{planIndex}}" data-direct="{{false}}" bindtap="use" disabled="{{busy}}">整套加入，再看看</button><button class="secondary" data-index="{{planIndex}}" data-direct="{{true}}" bindtap="use" disabled="{{busy}}">就吃这套，替换待选并提交</button></view><view class="muted recommendation-footnote">推荐是这间厨房里的一种搭配建议。食材信息不完整时，不会用于忌口推荐；过敏者仍应与厨师核对。</view></view>
